msgid "This extension doesn't manage material variation. That means that the generated file may include all instances with same materials."
msgstr "Detta tillägg hanterar inte materialvariation. Det innebär att den genererade filen kan innehålla alla instanser med samma material."

#: ../../manual/addons/import_export/scene_gltf2.rst:65
