msgstr "Mer finns skrivet om detta ämne här: :ref:`Directory Layout <blender-directory-layout>`."

#: ../../manual/advanced/scripting/addon_tutorial.rst:243
msgid "Your Second Add-on"
msgstr "Ditt andra tillägg"

#: ../../manual/advanced/scripting/addon_tutorial.rst:245
