#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/editing/properties.rst:13
msgid "Most bones' properties (except the transform ones) are regrouped in each bone's panels, in the *Bones* tab in *Edit Mode*. Let us detail them."
msgstr "De flesta av benens egenskaper (utom transformatoregenskaperna) är samlade i varje bens paneler, på fliken *Bones* i *Redigera Mode*. Låt oss beskriva dem i detalj."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/editing/properties.rst:16
msgid "Note that some of them are also available in the 3D Viewport, through the three pop-up menus within the same entry:"
msgstr "Observera att vissa av dem också är tillgängliga i 3D-vyn, via de tre popup-menyerna i samma post:"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/editing/properties.rst:19
