#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:38
#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/properties/display.rst:113
msgid "Bone Colors"
msgstr "Benfärger"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:40
msgid "Bones can be individually colored. You can either choose a color set from the predefined :ref:`theme <bpy.types.Theme>` list or define a custom one."
msgstr "Benen kan färgas individuellt. Du kan antingen välja en färguppsättning från den fördefinierade :ref:`theme <bpy.types.Theme>`-listan eller definiera en egen."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:45
msgid "When selecting *Custom Color Set*, you need to define three colors: Regular (for when the bone is not selected), Selected, and Active."
msgstr "När du väljer *Custom Color Set* måste du definiera tre färger: Regular (för när benet inte är markerat), Selected och Active."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:48
msgid "You can temporarily disable all the color assignments by unchecking :ref:`Bone Colors <bpy.types.Armature.show>` in the armature's Viewport Display panel."
msgstr "Du kan tillfälligt inaktivera alla färgtilldelningar genom att avmarkera :ref:`Bone Colors <bpy.types.Armature.show>` i armaturens Viewport Display-panel."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:51
msgid "Bone Color"
msgstr "Benets färg"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:52
msgid "The bone's primary color, affecting both Edit Mode and Pose Mode."
msgstr "Benets primära färg, som påverkar både Redigera Mode och Pose Mode."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:54
msgid "This color is stored on the armature data-block, so that if you have multiple armature objects that share this data-block, they will all use the same color."
msgstr "Denna färg lagras på armaturens datablock, så om du har flera armaturobjekt som delar detta datablock kommer de alla att använda samma färg."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:60
#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:70
msgid "Copy Bone Color to Selected"
msgstr "Kopiera benfärg till markerad"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:61
#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:71
msgid "Copy the bone color of the :term:`Active` bone to all selected bones."
msgstr "Kopiera benfärgen för :term:`Active`-benet till alla markerade ben."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:63
msgid "Pose Bone Color :guilabel:`Pose Mode`"
msgstr "Pose Benfärg :guilabel:`Pose Mode`"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:64
msgid "Lets you optionally override the above *Bone Color* in Pose Mode (by setting it to something else than *Default Colors*)."
msgstr "Ger dig möjlighet att åsidosätta ovanstående *Bone Color* i Pose Mode (genom att ställa in den på något annat än *Default Colors*)."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:67
msgid "This color is stored on the :term:`Pose Bone`, meaning it can be different in every armature object -- even ones that reference the same data-block."
msgstr "Denna färg lagras på :term:`Pose Bone`, vilket innebär att den kan vara olika i varje armaturobjekt - även de som refererar till samma datablock."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:77
msgid "Custom Shape"
msgstr "Anpassad form"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:79
msgid "Apart from custom colors, bones can also have custom shapes (in *Object Mode* and *Pose Mode*), using another object as a \"template.\""
msgstr "Förutom egna färger kan ben också ha egna former (i *Object Mode* och *Pose Mode*), med ett annat objekt som \"mall\""

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:84
