msgstr "Skala X, Y, Z"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:99
msgid "Additional scaling factor to apply to the custom shape."
msgstr "Ytterligare skalningsfaktor som ska tillämpas på den anpassade formen."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:101
msgid "Override Transform"
msgstr "Åsidosätt transform"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:102
msgid "Bone that defines the display transform of the custom shape."
msgstr "Bone som definierar visningstransformationen för den anpassade formen."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:106
msgid "Scale to Bone Length"
msgstr "Skala till benlängd"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/bones/properties/display.rst:107
