#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:7
msgid "Copy/Paste Pose"
msgstr "Kopiera/klistra in pose"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:12
msgid ":menuselection:`Pose --> Copy Pose`, :menuselection:`Pose --> Paste Pose`, :menuselection:`Pose --> Paste Pose Flipped`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Pose --> Copy Pose`, :menuselection:`Pose --> Paste Pose`, :menuselection:`Pose --> Paste Pose Flipped`"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:15
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl-C`, :kbd:`Ctrl-V`, :kbd:`Shift-Ctrl-V`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl-C`, :kbd:`Ctrl-V`, :kbd:`Shift-Ctrl-V`"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:19
msgid "Blender allows you to copy and paste a pose, either through the *Pose* menu, or by using hotkeys."
msgstr "I Blender kan du kopiera och klistra in en pose, antingen via menyn *Pose* eller med hjälp av snabbtangenter."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:22
#: ../../manual/animation/constraints/tracking/ik_solver.rst:72
msgid "Copy Pose"
msgstr "Kopiera Pose"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:23
msgid "Copy the current pose of selected bones into the pose buffer."
msgstr "Kopiera den aktuella posen för markerade ben till pose-bufferten."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:24
msgid "Paste Pose"
msgstr "Paste Pose"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:25
msgid "Paste the buffered pose to the currently posed armature."
msgstr "Klistra in den buffrade posen i den aktuella poserade armaturen."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:26
msgid "Paste Pose Flipped"
msgstr "Klistra in Pose Flippad"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:27
msgid "Paste the *X axis mirrored* buffered pose to the currently posed armature."
msgstr "Klistra in den buffrade *X-axelspeglade* posen till den aktuella poserade armaturen."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:29
msgid "Here are important points:"
msgstr "Här är viktiga punkter:"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:31
msgid "This tool works at the :term:`Blender session` level, which means you can use it across armatures, scenes, and even files. However, the pose buffer is not saved, so you lose it when you close Blender."
msgstr "Detta verktyg fungerar på :term:`Blender session`-nivå, vilket innebär att du kan använda det över armaturer, scener och till och med filer. Poseringsbufferten sparas dock inte, så du förlorar den när du stänger Blender."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:34
msgid "There is only one pose buffer."
msgstr "Det finns bara en posebuffert."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:35
msgid "Only the selected bones are taken into account during copying (i.e. you copy only selected bones' pose)."
msgstr "Endast de markerade benen beaktas vid kopieringen (dvs. du kopierar endast de markerade benens pose)."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:36
msgid "During pasting, on the other hand, bone selection has no importance. The copied pose is applied on a per-name basis (i.e. if you had a ``forearm`` bone selected when you copied the pose, the ``forearm`` bone of the current posed armature will get its pose when you paste it -- and if there is no such named bone, nothing will happen...)."
msgstr "Vid klistring har däremot benvalet ingen betydelse. Den kopierade posen tillämpas per namn (dvs. om du hade valt ett ben med namnet \"underarm\" när du kopierade posen, kommer benet \"underarm\" i den aktuella poserade armaturen att få sin pose när du klistrar in den - och om det inte finns något ben med detta namn händer ingenting...)."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:41
msgid "What is copied and pasted is in fact the position, rotation or scale of each bone, in its own space. This means that the resulting pasted pose might be very different from the originally copied one, depending on:"
msgstr "Det som kopieras och klistras in är i själva verket position, rotation eller skala för varje ben, i dess eget utrymme. Detta innebär att den klistrade posen kan skilja sig mycket från den ursprungligen kopierade, beroende på:"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:44
msgid "The rest position of the bones."
msgstr "Benens viloposition."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:45
msgid "And the current pose of their parents."
msgstr "Och den nuvarande ställningen för deras föräldrar."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:51
msgid "The rest position of the original armature."
msgstr "Den ursprungliga armaturens viloposition."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:55
msgid "The rest position of the destination armature."
msgstr "Målarmaturens viloposition."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:57
msgid "Examples of pose copy/paste."
msgstr "Exempel på posering copy/paste."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/editing/copy_paste.rst:61
