#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:31
msgid "Bone State Colors"
msgstr "Bone State-färger"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:33
msgid "The color of the bones are based on their state. There are six different color codes, ordered here by precedence (i.e. the bone will be of the color of the bottom-most valid state):"
msgstr "Benens färg är baserad på deras tillstånd. Det finns sex olika färgkoder, som här är ordnade efter prioritet (dvs. benet kommer att ha färgen för det giltiga tillstånd som ligger längst ned):"

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:39
msgid "Gray: Default."
msgstr "Grå: Standard."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:40
msgid "Blue wire-frame: in Pose Mode."
msgstr "Blå trådram: i Pose-läge."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:41
msgid "Green: with Constraint."
msgstr "Grön: med begränsning."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:42
msgid "Yellow: with :doc:`IK Solver constraint </animation/constraints/tracking/ik_solver>`."
msgstr "Gul: med :doc:`IK Solver-begränsning </animation/constraints/tracking/ik_solver>`."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:43
msgid "Orange: with Targetless Solver constraint."
msgstr "Orange: med Targetless Solver-restriktion."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/introduction.rst:47
msgid "When :ref:`bone colors <bpy.types.BoneColor>` are enabled, the state colors will be overridden."
msgstr "När :ref:`benfärger <bpy.types.BoneColor>` är aktiverade åsidosätts tillståndsfärgerna."

#: ../../manual/animation/armatures/posing/selecting.rst:6
msgid "Selection in *Pose Mode* is very similar to the one in :doc:`Edit Mode </animation/armatures/bones/selecting>`, with a few deviations: You can only select *whole bones* in *Pose Mode*, not roots/tips..."
msgstr "Selektering i *Pose Mode* är mycket lik den i :doc:`Redigera Mode </animation/armatures/bones/selecting>`, med några få avvikelser: Du kan bara välja *hela ben* i *Pose Mode*, inte rötter/spetsar..."

