msgid "Markers"
msgstr "Markörer"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:8
msgid "Markers are used to denote frames with key points or significant events within an animation. E.g. it could be that a character's animation starts, the camera changes position, or a door opens. Markers can be given names to make them more meaningful at a quick glance. They are available in many of Blender's editors."
msgstr "Markörer används för att markera bildrutor med nyckelpunkter eller viktiga händelser i en animation. Det kan t.ex. vara att en karaktärs animation startar, att kameran ändrar position eller att en dörr öppnas. Markörer kan ges namn för att göra dem mer meningsfulla vid en snabb blick. De finns tillgängliga i många av Blenders editorer."

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:15
msgid "Unlike keyframes, markers are always placed at a whole frame number, you cannot set a marker at frame 2.5."
msgstr "Till skillnad från keyframes placeras markörer alltid vid ett helt bildnummer, du kan inte placera en markör vid bild 2,5."

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:17
msgid "Markers can be created and edited in the following editors:"
msgstr "Markörer kan skapas och redigeras i följande editorer:"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:19
msgid ":doc:`Graph Editor </editors/graph_editor/introduction>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Graph Redigerare </editors/graph_editor/introduction>`"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`Dope Sheet </editors/dope_sheet/introduction>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Dope Sheet </editors/dope_sheet/introduction>`"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`NLA Editor </editors/nla/index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`NLA Redigerare </editors/nla/index>`"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:22
msgid ":doc:`Video Sequence Editor </video_editing/index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Video Sequence Editor </video_editing/index>`"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:23
msgid ":doc:`Timeline </editors/timeline>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Tidslinje </editors/timeline>`"

#: ../../manual/animation/markers.rst:27
msgid "A marker created in one of these editors will also appear in all others that support them."
msgstr "En markör som skapats i en av dessa editorer kommer också att visas i alla andra som stöder dem."

