msgstr "Hastighet"

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/filter/blur/vector_blur.rst:24
msgid "Input for the \"Vector\" render pass. See :doc:`Cycles render passes </render/layers/passes>`."
msgstr "Indata för renderingspasset \"Vector\". Se :doc:`Cycles render passes </render/layers/passes>`."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/filter/blur/vector_blur.rst:31
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/tracking/plane_track_deform.rst:43
