msgstr "Exempel på noden *Value*."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/input/value.rst:50
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/input/value.rst:45
msgid "From this you can also make different values proportional to each other by adding a :doc:`Math Node </compositing/types/utilities/math>` in between the different links."
msgstr "Från detta kan du också göra olika värden proportionella mot varandra genom att lägga till en :doc:`Math Node </compositing/types/utilities/math>` mellan de olika länkarna."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/input/image.rst:6
#: ../../manual/editors/texture_node/types/input/image.rst:5
