msgstr "Textur nod."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/input/texture.rst:12
msgid "The Texture node makes 3D textures available to the Compositor."
msgstr "Texture-noden gör 3D-texturer tillgängliga för Compositor."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/input/texture.rst:18
msgid "A vector (XYZ) transforming the origin of the texture."
msgstr "En vektor (XYZ) som omvandlar texturens ursprung."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/input/texture.rst:20
msgid "A vector (XYZ) to scale the texture."
msgstr "En vektor (XYZ) för att skala texturen."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/input/texture.rst:27
msgid "The texture can be selected from a list of textures available in the current blend-file or linked-in textures. The textures themselves can not be edited in the Compositor, but in the :doc:`Texture Node Editor </editors/texture_node/index>`."
msgstr "Texturen kan väljas från en lista över texturer som finns tillgängliga i den aktuella blend-filen eller länkade texturer. Själva texturerna kan inte redigeras i Compositor, utan i :doc:`Texture Node Redigerare </editors/texture_node/index>`."

