msgstr "Hörnpinnnod"

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:8
msgid "Corner Pin Node."
msgstr "Corner Pin Node."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:12
msgid "The Corner Pin node uses explicit corner values for a plane warp transformation. It works like the :doc:`Plane Track Deform </compositing/types/tracking/plane_track_deform>` node, but without using \"plane track\" data from the Movie Clip Editor."
msgstr "Noden Corner Pin använder explicita hörnvärden för en plan warp-transformation. Den fungerar som :doc:`Plane Track Deform </compositing/types/tracking/plane_track_deform>`-noden, men utan att använda \"plane track\"-data från Movie Clip Redigerare."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:22
#: ../../manual/modeling/geometry_nodes/mesh/operations/mesh_to_points.rst:0
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Hörn"

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:23
msgid "Four vector inputs to define the plane warping. (Z component of vector inputs is ignored.)"
msgstr "Fyra vektorinmatningar för att definiera planförvrängningen. (Z-komponenten i vektorinmatningarna ignoreras.)"

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:30
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/map_uv.rst:37
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/rotate.rst:28
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/scale.rst:28
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/transform.rst:36
#: ../../manual/video_editing/edit/montage/strips/effects/transform.rst:17
msgid "Determines how pixel values are interpolated when scaling or transforming images."
msgstr "Bestämmer hur pixelvärden interpoleras vid skalning eller transformering av bilder."

#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/corner_pin.rst:0
#: ../../manual/compositing/types/transform/map_uv.rst:0
