#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:10
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:5
msgid "Vector Math Node"
msgstr "Vector Math Node"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:12
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:7
msgid "Vector Math Node."
msgstr "Vector Math Node."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:16
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:11
msgid "The *Vector Math* node performs the selected math operation on the input vectors."
msgstr "Noden *Vector Math* utför den valda matematiska operationen på indatavektorerna."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:22
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:17
msgid "The inputs of the node are dynamic. Some inputs are only available in certain operations. For instance, the *Scale* input is only available in the *Scale* operator."
msgstr "Nodens inmatningar är dynamiska. Vissa indata är endast tillgängliga i vissa operationer. Inmatningen *Scale* är t.ex. endast tillgänglig i operatorn *Scale*."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:26
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:21
msgid "Input vector :math:`A = \\begin{pmatrix} A_x \\\\ A_y \\\\ A_z \\end{pmatrix}`."
msgstr "Inmatningsvektor :math:`A = \\begin{pmatrix} A_x \\\\ A_y \\\\ A_z \\end{pmatrix}`."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:28
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:23
msgid "Input vector :math:`B = \\begin{pmatrix} B_x \\\\ B_y \\\\ B_z \\end{pmatrix}`."
msgstr "Inmatningsvektor :math:`B = \\begin{pmatrix} B_x \\\\ B_y \\\\ B_z \\end{pmatrix}`."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:30
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:25
msgid "Input Scale :math:`s`."
msgstr "Inmatningsskala :math:`s`."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:37
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:32
msgid "The vector math operator to be applied on the input vectors."
msgstr "Den vektormatematiska operator som ska tillämpas på indatavektorerna."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:39
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:34
msgid "The sum of A and B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x + B_x \\\\ A_y + B_y \\\\ A_z + B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Summan av A och B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x + B_x \\\\ A_y + B_y \\\\ A_z + B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:41
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:36
msgid "The difference between A and B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x - B_x \\\\ A_y - B_y \\\\ A_z - B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Skillnaden mellan A och B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x - B_x \\\\ A_y - B_y \\\\ A_z - B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:43
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:38
msgid "The entrywise product of A and B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x \\cdot B_x \\\\ A_y \\cdot B_y \\\\ A_z \\cdot B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Den ingångsvisa produkten av A och B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x \\cdot B_x \\\\ A_y \\cdot B_y \\\\ A_z \\cdot B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:45
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:40
msgid "The entrywise division of A by B. Division by zero results in zero. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x / B_x \\\\ A_y / B_y \\\\ A_z / B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Den ingångsvisa divisionen av A med B. Division med noll resulterar i noll. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_x / B_x \\\\ A_y / B_y \\\\ A_z / B_z \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:48
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:43
msgid "The entrywise combination of the multiply and addition operations. :math:`A × B + C`"
msgstr "Den inmatningsvisa kombinationen av multiplicerings- och additionsoperationerna. :math:`A × B + C`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Cross Product"
msgstr "Kors produkt"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:50
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:45
msgid "The cross product of A and B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_y \\cdot B_z - A_z \\cdot B_y \\\\ A_z \\cdot B_x - A_x \\cdot B_z \\\\ A_x \\cdot B_y - A_y \\cdot B_x \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Korsprodukten av A och B. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} A_y \\cdot B_z - A_z \\cdot B_y \\\\ A_z \\cdot B_x - A_x \\cdot B_z \\\\ A_x \\cdot B_y - A_y \\cdot B_x \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/proxy.rst:0
#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/deform/shrinkwrap.rst:90
#: ../../manual/modeling/modifiers/deform/shrinkwrap.rst:80
#: ../../manual/physics/dynamic_paint/brush.rst:140
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
#: ../../manual/sculpt_paint/sculpting/tools/trim_tools.rst:0
msgid "Project"
msgstr "Projekt"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:53
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:48
msgid "The projection of A onto B."
msgstr "Projektionen av A på B."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Reflect"
msgstr "Reflektera"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:54
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:49
msgid "The reflection of A around the normal B. B need not be normalized."
msgstr "Reflektionen av A runt normalen B. B behöver inte normaliseras."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Refract"
msgstr "Refraktor"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:56
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:51
msgid "For a given incident vector A, surface normal B and ratio of indices of refraction (IOR), refract outputs the refraction vector R."
msgstr "För en given infallsvektor A, ytnormal B och förhållandet mellan brytningsindex (IOR), matar refract ut brytningsvektorn R."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Faceforward"
msgstr "Framåtblickande"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:58
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:53
msgid "Orients a vector A to point away from a surface B as defined by its normal C. Computes :math:`(dot(B, C) < 0) ? A : -A`."
msgstr "Orienterar en vektor A så att den pekar bort från en yta B som definieras av dess normal C. Beräknar :math:`(dot(B, C) < 0) ? A : -A`."

#: ../../manual/modeling/geometry_nodes/utilities/math/compare.rst:0
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Dot Product"
msgstr "Punktprodukt"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:60
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:55
msgid "The dot product of A and B. :math:`A_x \\cdot B_x + A_y \\cdot B_y + A_z \\cdot B_z`"
msgstr "Punktprodukten av A och B. :math:`A_x \\cdot B_x + A_y \\cdot B_y + A_z \\cdot B_z`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:62
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:57
msgid "The distance between A and B."
msgstr "Avståndet mellan A och B."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:63
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:58
msgid "The length of A. :math:`\\sqrt{A_x^2 + A_y^2 + A_z^2}`"
msgstr "Längden på A. :math:`\\sqrt{A_x^2 + A_y^2 + A_z^2}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:65
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:60
msgid "The result of multiplying A by the scalar input *Scale*. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} s \\cdot A_x \\\\ s \\cdot A_y \\\\ s \\cdot A_z \\end{pmatrix}`"
msgstr "Resultatet av att multiplicera A med den skalära indata *Scale*. :math:`\\begin{pmatrix} s \\cdot A_x \\\\ s \\cdot A_y \\\\ s \\cdot A_z \\end{pmatrix}`"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:67
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:62
msgid "The result of normalizing A. The result vector points to the same direction as A and has a length of 1. If A is (0, 0, 0), the result is (0, 0, 0) as well."
msgstr "Resultatet av normaliseringen av A. Resultatvektorn pekar åt samma håll som A och har längden 1. Om A är (0, 0, 0) är resultatet också (0, 0, 0)."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:69
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:64
msgid "The entrywise absolute value of A."
msgstr "Det inmatningsvisa absoluta värdet av A."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:70
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:65
msgid "The entrywise minimum value from A and B."
msgstr "Det lägsta värdet från A och B."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:71
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:66
msgid "The entrywise maximum value from A and B."
msgstr "Det inmatningsvisa maximala värdet från A och B."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:72
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:67
msgid "Rounds the input value entrywise down to the nearest integer."
msgstr "Avrundar inmatningsvärdet inmatningsvis nedåt till närmaste heltal."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:73
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:68
msgid "Rounds the input value entrywise up to the nearest integer."
msgstr "Avrundar inmatningsvärdet inmatningsvis uppåt till närmaste heltal."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:74
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:69
msgid "Returns the fractional part of the *value* entrywise."
msgstr "Returnerar bråkdelen av *värdet* inmatningsvis."

#: ../../manual/modeling/geometry_nodes/utilities/math/integer_math.rst:0
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:0
msgid "Modulo"
msgstr "Modulo"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:75
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:70
msgid "The entrywise modulo of A by B."
msgstr "Den inmatningsvisa modulo av A genom B."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:77
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:72
msgid "The entrywise output of a value between Min and Max based on the absolute difference between the input value and the nearest integer multiple of Max less than the value."
msgstr "Den inmatningsvisa utmatningen av ett värde mellan Min och Max baserat på den absoluta skillnaden mellan inmatningsvärdet och den närmaste heltalsmultipeln av Max som är mindre än värdet."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:79
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:74
msgid "The result of rounding A to the largest integer multiple of B less than or equal A."
msgstr "Resultatet av att avrunda A till den största heltalsmultipeln av B som är mindre än eller lika med A."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:80
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:75
msgid "The entrywise `Sine <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sine>`__ of A."
msgstr "Den ingångsvisa `Sine <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sine>`__ av A."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:81
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:76
msgid "The entrywise `Cosine <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trigonometric_functions>`__ of A."
msgstr "Den inmatningsbara `Cosine <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trigonometric_functions>`__ av A."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:82
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:77
msgid "The entrywise `Tangent <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trigonometric_functions>`__ of A."
msgstr "Den ingångsvisa `Tangent <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trigonometric_functions>`__ av A."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:88
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:83
msgid "The output of the node is dynamic. It is either a vector or a scalar depending on the operator. For instance, the *Length* operator has a scalar output while the *Add* operator has a vector output."
msgstr "Nodens utdata är dynamisk. Den är antingen en vektor eller en skalär beroende på operatorn. Operatorn *Length* har t.ex. en skalär utdata medan operatorn *Add* har en vektorutdata."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:92
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:87
msgid "Output vector."
msgstr "Utgångsvektor."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:94
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/converter/vector_math.rst:89
msgid "Output value."
msgstr "Utgående värde."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:10
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:5
msgid "Vector Rotate Node"
msgstr "Vektor Rotation Node"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:12
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:7
msgid "Vector Rotate Node."
msgstr "Vector Rotate Node."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:16
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:11
msgid "The *Vector Rotate Node* provides the ability to rotate a vector around a pivot point (*Center*)."
msgstr "Noden *Vector Rotate Node* gör det möjligt att rotera en vektor runt en pivotpunkt (*Center*)."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:23
#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vector_rotate.rst:18
msgid "Vector to be rotated."
msgstr "Vektor som ska roteras."

