msgid "Snaps using the current transformation center (another word for the :doc:`pivot point </editors/3dview/controls/pivot_point/index>`). This option is especially useful in combination with the :doc:`3D Cursor </editors/3dview/3d_cursor>` for choosing the snapping point completely manually."
