#: ../../manual/editors/3dview/display/overlays.rst:137
msgid "Display mesh edges. Similar to :ref:`Wireframe Shading <3dview-shading-rendered>`, but displays edges on top of existing shading. The value slider adjusts which edges to display: lower values hide edges on surfaces that are almost flat, while a value of 1 shows all edges."
