msgid "The above hotkeys align the view to a global (world) axis. You can also align to a local axis of the selected item by additionally holding :kbd:`Shift`. This way, you can for example view any mesh face head-on, no matter how it's oriented. (To get out of this local viewpoint, simply align to a global axis again.)"
