#: ../../manual/editors/3dview/viewport_render.rst:62
msgid "Activating *Viewport Render* will render from the current active view. This means that if you are not in an active camera view, a virtual camera is used to match the current perspective. To get an image from the camera point of view, enter the active camera view with :kbd:`Numpad0`."
