msgid "Sync Visible Range"
msgstr "Synkronisering Synligt område"

#: ../../manual/editors/dope_sheet/navigating.rst:97
#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/introduction.rst:150
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/introduction.rst:89
#: ../../manual/editors/timeline.rst:297
#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/navigating.rst:75
msgid "Synchronizes the horizontal panning and scale of the editor with other time-based editors that also have this option enabled. That way, they always show the same section of time."
msgstr "Synkroniserar den horisontella panoreringen och skalan i editorn med andra tidsbaserade editorer som också har det här alternativet aktiverat. På så sätt visar de alltid samma tidsavsnitt."

#: ../../manual/editors/dope_sheet/navigating.rst:103
