msgstr "Visa endast keyframes som hör till objekt/ben/... som är markerade."

#: ../../manual/editors/dope_sheet/navigating.rst:145
msgid "If this option is enabled, the Dope Sheet may not show all :doc:`material </render/materials/introduction>` keyframes of the selected objects. Instead, it only shows the keyframes belonging to the selected nodes in the :doc:`/editors/shader_editor`."
msgstr "Om det här alternativet är aktiverat kanske Dope Sheet inte visar alla :doc:`material </render/materials/introduction>` keyframes för de valda objekten. Istället visas endast de keyframes som hör till de valda noderna i :doc:`/editors/shader_editor`."

#: ../../manual/editors/dope_sheet/navigating.rst:149
#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/introduction.rst:328
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/introduction.rst:192
msgid "Show Hidden"
msgstr "Visa dolda filer"

