msgid "Filter items by name. The wildcard ``*`` will match anything, e.g. ``bl*er`` will match both ``blender`` and ``blogger``. There is always an implicit wildcard at the start and end of the search text, so ``blender`` will also match ``test_blender_file.blend``. This field can also be used to filter some specific file extension (e.g. ``.png`` will list all PNG files)."
