#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:103
msgid "Linear extrapolation."
msgstr "Linjär extrapolering."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:105
msgid "Continue in a straight line, keeping the same slope as on the first/last keyframe."
msgstr "Fortsätt i en rak linje med samma lutning som i den första/sista nyckelbilden."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:0
msgid "Make Cyclic"
msgstr "Gör cyklisk"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:108
msgid "Repeat the whole curve. This works by adding a :ref:`Cycles modifier <bpy.types.FModifierCycles>`."
msgstr "Upprepa hela kurvan. Detta fungerar genom att lägga till en :ref:`Cycles modifierare <bpy.types.FModifierCycles>`."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:0
msgid "Clear Cyclic"
msgstr "Rensa cyklisk"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:111
msgid "Remove the above modifier, making the curve non-repeating again."
msgstr "Ta bort ovanstående modifiering, vilket gör att kurvan inte upprepas igen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:116
msgid "Add F-Curve Modifier"
msgstr "Lägg till modifierare för F-kurva"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:120
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Add F-Curve Modifier`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Lägg till F-kurvmodifierare`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:123
msgid "Shows a submenu from where you can add a :doc:`modifier </editors/graph_editor/fcurves/modifiers>` to the active curve. Settings for these modifiers can be found in :menuselection:`Sidebar --> Modifiers`."
msgstr "Visar en undermeny där du kan lägga till en :doc:`modifierare </editors/graph_editor/fcurves/modifiers>` till den aktiva kurvan. Inställningar för dessa modifierare finns i :menuselection:`Sidebar --> Modifierare`."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:133
msgid "Hide Selected Curves :kbd:`H`"
msgstr "Dölj valda kurvor :kbd:`H`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:134
msgid "Hides the selected curves."
msgstr "Döljer de markerade kurvorna."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:135
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:625
#: ../../manual/movie_clip/masking/editing.rst:189
#: ../../manual/scene_layout/object/editing/show_hide.rst:17
msgid "Hide Unselected :kbd:`Shift-H`"
msgstr "Dölj icke valda :kbd:`Shift-H`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:136
msgid "Hides all curves except the selected ones."
msgstr "Döljer alla kurvor utom de markerade."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:137
msgid "Reveal Curves :kbd:`Alt-H`"
msgstr "Avslöja kurvor :kbd:`Alt-H`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:138
msgid "Shows all previous hidden curves."
msgstr "Visar alla tidigare dolda kurvor."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:145
msgid "Expand/Collapse Channels"
msgstr "Expandera/kollapsa kanaler"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:149
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Expand/Collapse Channels`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Expandera/sammanfoga kanaler`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:150
msgid ":kbd:`NumpadPlus`, :kbd:`NumpadMinus`"
msgstr ":kbd:`NumpadPlus`, :kbd:`NumpadMinus`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:152
msgid "Expands or collapses the selected headers."
msgstr "Expanderar eller komprimerar de markerade rubrikerna."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:162
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Move...`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Flytta...`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:164
msgid "Lets you reorder the selected channels or slots in the list:"
msgstr "Gör att du kan ändra ordningen på de valda kanalerna eller platserna i listan:"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:166
msgid "To the top :kbd:`Shift-PageUp`"
msgstr "Till toppen :kbd:`Shift-PageUp`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:167
msgid "Up one line :kbd:`PageUp`"
msgstr "En rad uppåt :kbd:`PageUp`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:168
msgid "Down one line :kbd:`PageDown`"
msgstr "En rad nedåt :kbd:`PageDown`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:169
msgid "To the bottom :kbd:`Shift-PageDown`"
msgstr "Till botten :kbd:`Shift-PageDown`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:175
msgid "Revive Disabled F-Curves"
msgstr "Återuppliva inaktiverade F-kurvor"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:179
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Revive Disabled F-Curves`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Återuppliva inaktiverade F-kurvor`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:181
msgid "Clears the \"disabled\" tag from all F-Curves to get broken F-Curves working again. (A curve is broken if it references a property that doesn't exist.)"
msgstr "Rensar taggen \"disabled\" från alla F-kurvor för att få trasiga F-kurvor att fungera igen. (En kurva är trasig om den refererar till en egenskap som inte finns)"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:187
msgid "Keys to Samples"
msgstr "Nycklar till prover"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:191
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Keys to Samples`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Nycklar till prover`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:192
#: ../../manual/interface/keymap/industry_compatible.rst:146
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves/editing/curve.rst:161
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves_new/editing/curves.rst:87
#: ../../manual/modeling/surfaces/editing/surface.rst:149
#: ../../manual/movie_clip/masking/editing.rst:65
msgid ":kbd:`Alt-C`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Alt-C`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:194
msgid "Switches the selected curves from interpolating between a set of keyframes to using a sampled value at each full frame. **This is a destructive process that removes the ability to edit the curve.** It's mainly used to reduce the file size with large datasets, as samples take up less space than keyframes."
msgstr "Växlar de valda kurvorna från att interpoleras mellan en uppsättning nyckelrutor till att använda ett samplat värde vid varje helruta. **Detta är en destruktiv process som tar bort möjligheten att redigera kurvan ** Det används främst för att minska filstorleken med stora dataset, eftersom samplingar tar mindre plats än nyckelrutor."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:200
msgid "Between samples (on subframes), the curve interpolates linearly."
msgstr "Mellan samplingar (på subframes) interpolerar kurvan linjärt."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:206
msgid "Samples to Keys"
msgstr "Prover till nycklar"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:210
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Samples to Keys`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Prover till nycklar`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:212
msgid "Switches the selected curves from using samples to using keyframes, making them editable. Note that this creates a keyframe on every frame."
msgstr "Ändrar de valda kurvorna från att använda samples till att använda keyframes, vilket gör dem redigerbara. Observera att detta skapar en keyframe för varje bildruta."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:219
msgid "Sound to Samples"
msgstr "Ljud till prover"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:223
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Sound to Samples`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Ljud till Samples`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:225
msgid "Creates a sampled curve based on a sound file. Use *Samples to Keys* if you need to edit it."
msgstr "Skapar en samplad kurva baserad på en ljudfil. Använd *Samples to Keys* om du behöver redigera den."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:227
msgid "Lowest Frequency"
msgstr "Lägsta frekvens"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:228
msgid "Cutoff frequency of a high-pass filter that is applied to the audio data."
msgstr "Cutoff-frekvens för ett högpassfilter som appliceras på ljuddata."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:229
msgid "Highest Frequency"
msgstr "Högsta frekvens"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:230
msgid "Cutoff frequency of a low-pass filter that is applied to the audio data."
msgstr "Cutoff-frekvens för ett lågpassfilter som appliceras på ljuddata."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:231
msgid "Attack Time"
msgstr "Attacktid"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:232
msgid "Value for the hull curve calculation that tells how fast the hull curve can rise. The lower the value, the steeper it can rise."
msgstr "Värde för beräkning av skrovkurvan som anger hur snabbt skrovkurvan kan stiga. Ju lägre värde, desto brantare kan den stiga."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:234
msgid "Release Time"
msgstr "Frigöringstid"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:235
msgid "Value for the hull curve calculation that tells how fast the hull curve can fall. The lower the value, the steeper it can fall."
msgstr "Värde för beräkning av skrovkurva som talar om hur snabbt skrovkurvan kan falla. Ju lägre värde, desto brantare kan den falla."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:238
msgid "Minimum amplitude value needed to influence the hull curve."
msgstr "Minsta amplitudvärde som behövs för att påverka skrovets kurva."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:240
#: ../../manual/sculpt_paint/brush/brush_settings.rst:194
msgid "Accumulate"
msgstr "Ackumulera"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:241
msgid "Only the positive differences of the hull curve amplitudes are summarized to produce the output."
msgstr "Endast de positiva skillnaderna i skrovkurvornas amplituder sammanfattas för att producera utdata."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:243
msgid "The amplitudes of the hull curve are summarized. If *Accumulate* is enabled, both positive and negative differences are accumulated."
msgstr "Amplituderna för skrovkurvan sammanfattas. Om *Accumulate* är aktiverat ackumuleras både positiva och negativa skillnader."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:246
msgid "Gives the output as a square curve. Negative values always result in -1, and positive ones in 1."
msgstr "Ger utdata som en kvadratisk kurva. Negativa värden resulterar alltid i -1 och positiva i 1."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:249
msgid "Square Threshold"
msgstr "Kvadratisk tröskel"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:250
msgid "All values lower than this threshold result in 0."
msgstr "Alla värden som är lägre än detta tröskelvärde resulterar i 0."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:256
msgid "Bake Channels"
msgstr "Bakningskanaler"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:260
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Bake Channels`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Baka kanaler`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:262
msgid "Generates new keyframes for the selected curves."
msgstr "Skapar nya keyframes för de markerade kurvorna."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:264
#: ../../manual/editors/timeline.rst:55
#: ../../manual/render/output/properties/frame_range.rst:4
#: ../../manual/render/output/properties/metadata.rst:32
#: ../../manual/video_editing/edit/montage/editing.rst:45
msgid "Frame Range"
msgstr "Ramområde"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:265
msgid "The range that will be baked. Defaults to the scene range or preview range."
msgstr "Det område som ska bakas. Standardvärdet är scenområdet eller förhandsgranskningsområdet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:266
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/editing/strip.rst:241
msgid "Frame Step"
msgstr "Ram steg"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:267
msgid "Distance between keyframes. Can be used to create a keyframe every 10 frames or even every half frame."
msgstr "Avstånd mellan keyframes. Kan användas för att skapa en keyframe var 10:e bildruta eller till och med var halva bildruta."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:268
msgid "Remove Outside Range"
msgstr "Ta bort utanför intervallet"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:269
msgid "Removes existing keys outside the specified baking range."
msgstr "Tar bort befintliga nycklar utanför det angivna bakintervallet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:271
msgid "The :ref:`interpolation type <editors-graph-fcurves-settings-interpolation>` for the new keys."
msgstr ":ref:`interpolationstyp <editors-graph-fcurves-settings-interpolation>` för de nya nycklarna."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:272
msgid "Bake Modifiers"
msgstr "Bake Modifierare"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:273
msgid "If enabled, the new keyframes are based on the modified curve, and the modifiers get deleted."
msgstr "Om den är aktiverad baseras de nya keyframesna på den modifierade kurvan och modifierarna raderas."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:275
msgid "If disabled, the new keyframes are based on the original curve, and the modifiers stay applied."
msgstr "Om den inaktiveras baseras de nya keyframes på den ursprungliga kurvan och modifierarna fortsätter att gälla."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:280
msgid "Discontinuity (Euler) Filter"
msgstr "Diskontinuitet (Euler) Filter"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:284
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Discontinuity (Euler) Filter`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Diskontinuitet (Euler) Filter`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:286
msgid "Cleans up Euler rotation channels that suffer from :term:`Gimbal Lock`. The channels of all three euler rotation axes need to be selected for this to work."
msgstr "Rensar upp Euler-rotationskanaler som lider av :term:`Gimbal Lock`. Kanalerna för alla tre euler-rotationsaxlarna måste vara valda för att detta ska fungera."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:292
msgid "Frame Selected Channels"
msgstr "Ram valda kanaler"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:296
msgid ":menuselection:`Channel --> Frame Selected Channels`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kanal --> Ram valda kanaler`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/editing.rst:299
msgid "Pans and zooms the view to show all keyframes of the selected curves. You can also click a channel with :kbd:`Alt-MMB`."
msgstr "Panorerar och zoomar vyn för att visa alla keyframes för de valda kurvorna. Du kan också klicka på en kanal med :kbd:`Alt-MMB`."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:13
msgid "The Channels region."
msgstr "Regionen Channels (Kanaler)."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:15
msgid "This region is found on the left side of time-based editors like the :doc:`/editors/timeline`, the :doc:`Dope Sheet Editor </editors/dope_sheet/introduction>`, and the Graph Editor. It shows a tree of items (objects, bones...) and their animated properties, with the latter also being called \"channels.\" Each channel has an associated F-curve describing how its value changes over time."
msgstr "Denna region finns på vänster sida av tidsbaserade editorer som :doc:`/editors/timeline`, :doc:`Dope Sheet Redigerare </editors/dope_sheet/introduction>` och Graph Redigerare. Den visar ett träd med objekt (föremål, ben...) och deras animerade egenskaper, där de senare också kallas \"kanaler\" Varje kanal har en tillhörande F-kurva som beskriver hur dess värde förändras över tid."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:21
msgid "The rows are color-coded as follows:"
msgstr "Raderna är färgkodade på följande sätt:"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:23
msgid "Dark blue: scenes, objects"
msgstr "Mörkblå: scener, föremål"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:24
msgid "Light blue: :doc:`actions </animation/actions>`, :doc:`shape keys </animation/shape_keys/index>` etc."
msgstr "Ljusblå: :doc:`actions </animation/actions>`, :doc:`shape keys </animation/shape_keys/index>` etc."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:25
msgid "Green: channel groups"
msgstr "Grön: kanalgrupper"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:26
msgid "Gray: channels"
msgstr "Grå: kanaler"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:32
msgid "Lets you filter the channels by typing a part of their name. Click the Invert button to instead show channels that *don't* include the search text."
msgstr "Låter dig filtrera kanalerna genom att skriva in en del av deras namn. Klicka på knappen Invertera för att istället visa kanaler som *inte* innehåller söktexten."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:39
msgid "The headers contain the following toggle buttons:"
msgstr "Rubrikerna innehåller följande växlingsknappar:"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:42
msgid "Keep the row and its children visible even when selecting a different object."
msgstr "Håll raden och dess underordnade objekt synliga även när du väljer ett annat objekt."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:43
#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/properties/layers.rst:56
msgid "Hide (eye icon)"
msgstr "Dölj (ögonikon)"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:44
msgid "Hides the keyframes and curve associated with the channel."
msgstr "Döljer de keyframes och kurvor som är kopplade till kanalen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:45
msgid "Modifiers (wrench icon)"
msgstr "Modifierare (skiftnyckelsymbol)"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:46
msgid "Deactivates the modifiers of the curve."
msgstr "Avaktiverar kurvans modifierare."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:47
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/sidebar.rst:95
msgid "Mute (checkbox)"
msgstr "Ljud av (kryssruta)"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:48
msgid "Deactivates the curve, making the animation behave as though it doesn't exist."
msgstr "Avaktiverar kurvan, vilket gör att animationen beter sig som om den inte existerar."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:49
msgid "Lock :kbd:`Tab` (padlock icon)"
msgstr "Lås :kbd:`Tab` (hänglås-ikon)"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:50
msgid "Prevent the curve from being edited."
msgstr "Förhindra att kurvan kan redigeras."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:54
msgid "This also works in the :doc:`Nonlinear Animation Editor </editors/nla/introduction>`, but note that it only locks the strips there, not the underlying F-curves."
msgstr "Detta fungerar också i :doc:`Nonlinear Animation Redigerare </editors/nla/introduction>`, men observera att det bara låser remsorna där, inte de underliggande F-kurvorna."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:61
msgid "Select single header: click :kbd:`LMB`"
msgstr "Välj enkel rubrik: klicka på :kbd:`LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:62
msgid "Add/Remove single header to/from selection: click :kbd:`Ctrl-LMB`"
msgstr "Lägg till/ta bort enstaka rubrik till/från urval: klicka på :kbd:`Ctrl-LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:63
msgid "Select range: click :kbd:`Shift-LMB`"
msgstr "Välj intervall: klicka på :kbd:`Shift-LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:64
msgid "Select All: :kbd:`A`"
msgstr "Välj alla: :kbd:`A`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:65
msgid "Deselect All: press :kbd:`Alt-A` or double-tap :kbd:`A`"
msgstr "Avmarkera alla: tryck på :kbd:`Alt-A` eller dubbeltryck på :kbd:`A`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:66
msgid "Box Select: drag :kbd:`LMB`"
msgstr "Box Select: dra :kbd:`LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:67
msgid "Box Add: drag :kbd:`Shift-LMB`"
msgstr "Box Add: dra :kbd:`Shift-LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:68
msgid "Box Remove: drag :kbd:`Ctrl-LMB`"
msgstr "Ta bort box: dra :kbd:`Ctrl-LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:69
msgid "Select all keyframes in the channel: double-click :kbd:`LMB` on its header."
msgstr "Välj alla keyframes i kanalen: dubbelklicka på :kbd:`LMB` på dess rubrik."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:75
msgid "Rename (anything but a channel): double-click :kbd:`LMB`"
msgstr "Byt namn (på allt utom en kanal): dubbelklicka på :kbd:`LMB`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:76
msgid "Delete selected: :kbd:`X` or :kbd:`Delete`"
msgstr "Radera markerat: :kbd:`X` eller :kbd:`Delete`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:77
msgid "Lock selected: :kbd:`Tab`"
msgstr "Lås valt: :kbd:`Tab`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:80
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "Sliders"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:84
msgid "The Action editor showing sliders."
msgstr "Action-editorn visar reglage."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/channels/introduction.rst:86
msgid "If you enable :menuselection:`View --> Show Sliders`, the region will show a value slider next to each channel. Changing such a slider will change the value of the curve at the current frame, creating a keyframe if one doesn't already exist."
msgstr "Om du aktiverar :menuselection:`View --> Show Sliders`, kommer regionen att visa ett värdereglage bredvid varje kanal. Om du ändrar ett sådant reglage ändras kurvans värde i den aktuella bildrutan, vilket skapar en nyckelbild om det inte redan finns någon."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:3
msgid "Editing F-Curves"
msgstr "Redigering av F-kurvor"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:11
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Transform`"
msgstr "::menuselection:`Nyckel --> Transform`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:13
msgid "An F-Curve can be edited by transforming the locations of its keyframes."
msgstr "En F-kurva kan redigeras genom att ändra positionerna för dess keyframes."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:15
#: ../../manual/interface/keymap/industry_compatible.rst:121
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves/editing/curve.rst:22
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves_new/editing/curves.rst:16
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/mesh/transform/basic.rst:4
#: ../../manual/modeling/surfaces/editing/surface.rst:22
msgid "Move, Rotate, Scale"
msgstr "Flytta, rotera, skala"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:16
msgid "Like other elements in Blender, keyframes can be moved, rotated, and scaled as described in :doc:`Basic Transformations </scene_layout/object/editing/transform/introduction>`."
msgstr "Precis som andra element i Blender kan keyframes flyttas, roteras och skalas enligt beskrivningen i :doc:`Basic Transformations </scene_layout/object/editing/transform/introduction>`."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:19
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/editing/strip.rst:16
msgid "Extend :kbd:`E`"
msgstr "Förlänga :kbd:`E`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:20
msgid "Lets you quickly move the selected keyframes that are on a certain side of the Playhead. This is handy if you need to, say, move all the keyframes after a certain time point to the right to make space for new ones."
msgstr "Gör att du snabbt kan flytta de valda keyframes som befinner sig på en viss sida av Playhead. Detta är praktiskt om du t.ex. behöver flytta alla keyframes efter en viss tidpunkt till höger för att ge plats åt nya."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:24
msgid "To use this operator, first select some or all keyframes and place your mouse cursor to the left or right of the Playhead. Then, press :kbd:`E`, move the mouse to move (only) the keyframes on that side of the Playhead, and press :kbd:`LMB` to confirm (or :kbd:`RMB` to cancel)."
