msgstr ":menuselection:`Nyckel --> Densitet --> Decimera (tillåten ändring)`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:297
msgid "Simplifies an F-Curve by removing the keyframes that influence its shape the least."
msgstr "Förenklar en F-kurva genom att ta bort de keyframes som påverkar dess form minst."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:300
msgid "How to pick the number of keyframes to delete."
msgstr "Hur man väljer antalet keyframes som ska tas bort."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:303
msgid "Deletes a certain percentage of keyframes."
msgstr "Raderar en viss procentandel av keyframes."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:306
msgid "The percentage of keyframes to remove."
msgstr "Procentandelen keyframes som ska tas bort."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:308
msgid "Error Margin"
msgstr "Felmarginal"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:309
msgid "Deletes as many keyframes as possible while ensuring the F-Curve's shape changes no more than a certain amount."
msgstr "Raderar så många keyframes som möjligt samtidigt som F-kurvans form inte ändras mer än en viss mängd."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:312
msgid "Max Error Margin"
msgstr "Max felmarginal"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:313
msgid "How much the decimated curve may deviate from the original."
msgstr "Hur mycket den decimerade kurvan får avvika från den ursprungliga."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:319
msgid "Bake Keyframes"
msgstr "Baka nyckelramar"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:323
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Density --> Bake Keyframes`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Density --> Bake Keyframes`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:324
msgid ":kbd:`Shift-Alt-O`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift-Alt-O`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:326
msgid "Creates a keyframe at every frame."
msgstr "Skapar en keyframe vid varje bildruta."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:329
msgid ":ref:`Bake Channels <bpy.ops.graph.channels_bake>`, which offers options on what range to bake and how."
msgstr ":ref:`Bake Channels <bpy.ops.graph.channels_bake>`, som erbjuder alternativ för vilket intervall som ska bakas och hur."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:336
msgid "F-Curve before baking."
msgstr "F-kurva före bakning."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:340
msgid "F-Curve after baking."
msgstr "F-kurva efter bakning."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:346
msgid "Clean Keyframes"
msgstr "Rena nyckelramar"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:350
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Density --> Clean Keyframes`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Density --> Clean Keyframes`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:353
msgid "Finds redundant keyframes among the selected ones and deletes them. A keyframe is seen as redundant if it has the same value as its neighbors -- even if the curve segments around it aren't flat."
msgstr "Hittar överflödiga keyframes bland de markerade och raderar dem. En keyframe betraktas som överflödig om den har samma värde som sina grannar - även om kurvsegmenten runt den inte är plana."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:359
msgid "This operator is likely to change the shape of the affected curves, so it's best run after e.g. bulk keyframe insertion on all the bones of an armature (which creates useless keyframes on bones that haven't moved) and before tweaking the curves by hand."
msgstr "Denna operator kommer sannolikt att ändra formen på de berörda kurvorna, så det är bäst att köra den efter t.ex. bulk keyframe insertion på alla ben i en armatur (vilket skapar värdelösa keyframes på ben som inte har rört sig) och innan du justerar kurvorna för hand."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:364
msgid "Value threshold. By increasing this, you can also delete keyframes that *almost* have the same value as their neighbors."
msgstr "Tröskelvärde för värde. Genom att öka detta kan du också ta bort keyframes som *nästan* har samma värde som sina grannar."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:368
msgid "Cleans all the keyframes (even unselected ones) in the selected F-Curves. If a curve is left with only one keyframe, it's deleted entirely."
msgstr "Rensar alla keyframes (även de som inte är markerade) i de markerade F-kurvorna. Om en kurva bara har en keyframe kvar raderas den helt och hållet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:375
msgid "F-Curve before cleaning."
msgstr "F-kurva före rengöring."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:379
msgid "F-Curve after cleaning."
msgstr "F-kurva efter rengöring."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:387
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend`"
msgstr "::menuselection:`Nyckel --> Blandning`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:388
#: ../../manual/editors/nla/editing/strip.rst:117
#: ../../manual/interface/controls/nodes/editing.rst:169
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/vertex/rip_vertices_extend.rst:12
#: ../../manual/scene_layout/object/editing/duplicate_linked.rst:11
msgid ":kbd:`Alt-D`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Alt-D`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:390
msgid "Adjusts the values of the selected keyframes by a certain percentage. Select a blending operator, move the mouse left or right to adjust the factor, and click :kbd:`LMB` to confirm (or :kbd:`RMB` to cancel)."
msgstr "Justerar värdena för de valda keyframes med en viss procentsats. Välj en blandningsoperator, flytta musen åt vänster eller höger för att justera faktorn och klicka på :kbd:`LMB` för att bekräfta (eller :kbd:`RMB` för att avbryta)."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:394
msgid "Several blending operators work based on \"neighboring keyframes.\" This means that they divide the selected keyframes into contiguous groups, then reference the unselected keyframes immediately before and after each group."
msgstr "Flera blandningsoperatorer arbetar utifrån \"närliggande nyckelrutor\" Det innebär att de valda nyckelrutorna delas in i sammanhängande grupper och sedan refererar till de icke valda nyckelrutorna omedelbart före och efter varje grupp."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:401
msgid "Breakdown"
msgstr "Fördelning av betalningar"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:405
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Breakdown`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Breakdown`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:407
msgid "Sets the value of the selected keyframes to an interpolation of their neighbors."
msgstr "Ställer in värdet för de valda keyframesen till en interpolering av deras grannar."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:410
msgid "At -1, the keyframes are set to the value of the left neighbor."
msgstr "Vid -1 ställs nyckelramarna in på värdet för den vänstra grannen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:412
msgid "At 1, they're set to the value of the right neighbor."
msgstr "Vid 1 är de inställda på värdet för den högra grannen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:414
msgid "For other factors, they're set to an interpolation between the two neighbor values, with 0 being right in the middle."
msgstr "För andra faktorer är de inställda på en interpolering mellan de två grannvärdena, där 0 är precis i mitten."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:425
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend to Neighbor`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend to Neighbor`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:427
msgid "Moves each selected keyframe towards the value of the left or right neighbor by a certain percentage."
msgstr "Flyttar varje vald keyframe mot värdet för den vänstra eller högra grannen med en viss procentsats."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:430
msgid "When negative, each keyframe moves *Blend* percent to the value of the left neighbor."
msgstr "När den är negativ flyttar varje keyframe *Blend* procent till värdet för den vänstra grannen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:432
msgid "When positive, they move to the right neighbor."
msgstr "När de är positiva flyttas de till den högra grannen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:434
msgid "When zero, they keep their original values."
msgstr "När de är noll behåller de sina ursprungliga värden."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:440
msgid "Blend to Default Value"
msgstr "Blanda till standardvärde"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:444
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend to Default Value`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend till standardvärde`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:446
msgid "Moves the selected keyframes towards the property's default value by a certain percentage."
msgstr "Flyttar de valda nyckelrutorna mot egenskapens standardvärde med en viss procentsats."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:449
msgid "How much to change the keyframes' values, going from 0 (no change) to 1 (reset to the default value)."
msgstr "Hur mycket keyframes-värdena ska ändras, från 0 (ingen ändring) till 1 (återställs till standardvärdet)."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:453
msgid "The :ref:`Reset to Default <bpy.ops.ui.reset_default_button>` operator resets any property to its default value without the need of keyframing."
msgstr "Operatorn :ref:`Reset to Default <bpy.ops.ui.reset_default_button>` återställer en egenskap till dess standardvärde utan att behöva använda keyframing."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:460
#: ../../manual/interface/controls/templates/color_ramp.rst:0
msgid "Ease"
msgstr "Försiktigt"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:464
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Ease`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Nyckel --> Blandning --> Lätthet`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:466
msgid "Makes the selected keyframes follow an S-curve. While the slider is visible (so after activating the operator but before confirming with :kbd:`LMB`), you can press :kbd:`Tab` to toggle which of the following settings to edit:"
msgstr "Gör så att de valda keyframes följer en S-kurva. När skjutreglaget är synligt (dvs. efter att operatören har aktiverats men innan du bekräftar med :kbd:`LMB`) kan du trycka på :kbd:`Tab` för att växla mellan vilka av följande inställningar som ska redigeras:"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:470
msgid "Curve Bend"
msgstr "Kurva Böj"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:471
msgid "A negative value gives more weight to the left side, while a positive value gives more weight to the right. A value of 0 results in a balanced curve."
msgstr "Ett negativt värde ger mer vikt åt vänster sida, medan ett positivt värde ger mer vikt åt höger. Ett värde på 0 resulterar i en balanserad kurva."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:475
msgid "A low value results in an almost straight diagonal line, while a high value results in a steep rise/drop in the curve."
msgstr "Ett lågt värde resulterar i en nästan rak diagonal linje, medan ett högt värde resulterar i en brant uppgång/nedgång i kurvan."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:481
msgid "Blend Offset"
msgstr "Blend Offset"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:485
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend Offset`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend Offset`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:487
msgid "Moves the selected keyframes up or down -- all by the same amount -- until the first/last one matches the left/right neighbor."
msgstr "Flyttar de markerade keyframes upp eller ner - alla med samma belopp - tills den första/ sista matchar den vänstra/högra grannen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:490
msgid "Offset Factor"
msgstr "Offset-faktor"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:491
msgid "At -1, the first selected key gets aligned to its left neighbor."
msgstr "Vid -1 justeras den första markerade nyckeln till sin vänstra granne."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:493
msgid "At 1, the last selected key gets aligned to its right neighbor."
msgstr "Vid 1 justeras den senast valda nyckeln till sin högra granne."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:495
#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:516
msgid "At 0, nothing changes."
msgstr "Vid 0 ändras ingenting."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:501
msgid "Blend to Ease"
msgstr "Blanda för att lindra"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:505
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend to Ease`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Blend to Ease`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:507
msgid "Blends the selected keys to either an \"ease in\" or an \"ease out\" curve."
msgstr "Blandar de valda tangenterna till antingen en \"ease in\"- eller en \"ease out\"-kurva."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:510
msgid "At -1, the keys will follow an \"ease in\" curve, with small value changes in the beginning and large changes towards the end."
msgstr "Vid -1 kommer tangenterna att följa en \"ease in\"-kurva, med små värdeförändringar i början och stora förändringar mot slutet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:513
msgid "At 1, the keys will follow an \"ease out\" curve, with large value changes in the beginning and small changes towards the end."
msgstr "Vid 1 kommer tangenterna att följa en \"ease out\"-kurva, med stora värdeförändringar i början och små förändringar mot slutet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:522
msgid "Match Slope"
msgstr "Match Slope"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:526
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Match Slope`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Match Slope`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:528
msgid "Blends the selected keys towards a straight line going through two keys just outside the current selection."
msgstr "Blandar de valda tangenterna mot en rak linje som går genom två tangenter precis utanför det aktuella valet."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:531
msgid "Negative values use the two keys to the left of the selection."
msgstr "För negativa värden används de två knapparna till vänster om markeringen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:533
msgid "Positive values use the keys to the right."
msgstr "För positiva värden används knapparna till höger."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:535
msgid "At zero, nothing changes."
msgstr "Vid noll förändras ingenting."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:540
msgid "Push Pull"
msgstr "Tryck Dra"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:544
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Push Pull`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Push Pull`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:546
msgid "Moves the selected keys towards, or away from, the straight line going through the first and last selected key."
msgstr "Flyttar de markerade tangenterna mot eller bort från den raka linje som går genom den första och sista markerade tangenten."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:550
msgid "At 0, the keys will lie on the straight line."
msgstr "Vid 0 kommer nycklarna att ligga på den raka linjen."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:552
#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:589
msgid "At 1, they keep their original values."
msgstr "Vid 1 behåller de sina ursprungliga värden."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:554
msgid "At 2, each key's value will be twice as far from the straight line as before."
msgstr "Vid 2 kommer varje nyckels värde att ligga dubbelt så långt från den raka linjen som tidigare."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:559
msgid "Shear Keys"
msgstr "Skjuvnycklar"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:563
msgid ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Shear Keys`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Key --> Blend --> Shear Keys`"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:565
msgid "Shears the selected keyframes -- that is, changes their value by an amount that increases as they get further away in time from a reference keyframe. By default, this reference keyframe is the leftmost selected one, but you can instead use the rightmost one by pressing :kbd:`D`."
msgstr "Klipper de markerade nyckelrutorna, dvs. ändrar deras värde med ett belopp som ökar ju längre bort i tiden de kommer från en referensnyckelruta. Som standard är denna referenskeyframe den längst till vänster, men du kan istället använda den längst till höger genom att trycka på :kbd:`D`."

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:569
msgid "Shear Factor"
msgstr "Skjuvfaktor"

#: ../../manual/editors/graph_editor/fcurves/editing.rst:570
msgid "How much to shear. Negative values move keyframes downwards, while positive ones move them up."
msgstr "Hur mycket man ska klippa. Negativa värden flyttar keyframes nedåt, medan positiva värden flyttar dem uppåt."

