#: ../../manual/editors/image/overlays.rst:6
msgid "The Overlays pop-over configures the overlays that are displayed on top of images. In the header, there is a button to turn off all overlays for the Image Editor. This option also toggles the visibility of :doc:`UDIM </modeling/meshes/uv/workflows/udims>` tile information."
