msgstr ":menuselection:`Sidebar --> Strip --> Compositing`"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:35
msgid "The method for blending the current strip with strips in lower channels. See :term:`Blend Modes` for more information."
msgstr "Metoden för att blanda den aktuella remsan med remsor i lägre kanaler. Se :term:`Blend Modes` för mer information."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:38
msgid "The opacity (:term:`alpha <Alpha Channel>`) of the strip."
msgstr "Bandets opacitet (:term:`alpha <Alpha Channel>`)."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:40
msgid "When this property is animated, the opacity is drawn as an overlay on the strip. The overlay will look like a dark section that follows the animation curve. This can be hidden by disabling the :ref:`F-Curves <bpy.types.SequencerTimelineOverlay.show_fcurves>`."
msgstr "När den här egenskapen animeras ritas opaciteten som ett överlägg på remsan. Överlägget kommer att se ut som ett mörkt avsnitt som följer animeringskurvan. Detta kan döljas genom att inaktivera :ref:`F-Curves <bpy.types.SequencerTimelineOverlay.show_fcurves>`."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:52
msgid ":menuselection:`Sidebar --> Strip --> Transform`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Sidebar --> Strip --> Transform`"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:57
msgid "The technique used to estimate the values of pixels at non-integer coordinates within the image."
msgstr "Den teknik som används för att uppskatta värdena för pixlar vid icke heltaliga koordinater i bilden."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:60
msgid "Automatically choose filter based on scaling factor."
msgstr "Välj automatiskt filter baserat på skalningsfaktor."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:62
msgid "No scale, no rotation, integer positions: *Nearest*"
msgstr "Ingen skala, ingen rotation, heltalspositioner: *Närmast*"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:63
msgid "Scaling up by more than 2x: *Cubic Mitchell*"
msgstr "Skalar upp med mer än 2x: *Kubisk Mitchell*"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:64
msgid "Scaling down by more than 2x: *Box*"
msgstr "Skalar ner med mer än 2x: *Box*"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:65
msgid "Otherwise: Bilinear"
msgstr "Annars..: Bilineär"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:66
msgid "No interpolation; uses nearest neighboring pixel (fastest)."
msgstr "Ingen interpolering; använder närmast angränsande pixel (snabbast)."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:67
msgid "Interpolate between 2×2 samples."
msgstr "Interpolera mellan 2×2 sampel."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:0
msgid "Cubic Mitchell"
msgstr "Kubisk Mitchell"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:68
msgid "Cubic Mitchell filter on 4×4 samples."
msgstr "Kubiskt Mitchell-filter på 4×4 sampel."

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:0
msgid "Cubic B-Spline"
msgstr "Kubisk B-Spline"

#: ../../manual/editors/video_sequencer/sequencer/sidebar/strip.rst:69
msgid "Cubic B-Spline filter (blurry but no ringing) on 4×4 samples."
msgstr "Kubiskt B-Spline-filter (oskarp men ingen ringning) på 4×4 samplingar."

