#: ../../manual/getting_started/configuration/defaults.rst:49
msgid "Choose between a light or dark theme for Blender. Themes can be customized more in the :doc:`Preferences </editors/preferences/themes>`. Additional themes can be installed by visiting the `Blender Extensions Platform <https://extensions.blender.org/>`__. This is optional, and will require internet access."
msgstr "Välj mellan ett ljust eller mörkt tema för Blender. Teman kan anpassas ytterligare i :doc:`Preferences </editors/preferences/themes>`. Ytterligare teman kan installeras genom att besöka `Blender Extensions Platform <https://extensions.blender.org/>`__. Detta är valfritt och kräver internetåtkomst."

