msgid "Context-Sensitive Manual Access"
msgstr "Kontextkänslig manuell åtkomst"

#: ../../manual/getting_started/help.rst:56
msgid ":menuselection:`Context menu --> Online Manual`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kontextmeny --> Online Manual`"

