#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modes/edit/stroke_menu.rst:250
msgid "Sets the active object material based on the selected stroke material."
msgstr "Ställer in det aktiva objektmaterialet baserat på det valda stroke-materialet."

#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modes/edit/stroke_menu.rst:256
