#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modes/edit/stroke_menu.rst:366
msgid "The *Switch Direction* operator reverses the direction of the selected Grease Pencil stroke. This means the starting point of the stroke becomes the endpoint, and vice versa. While this operation does not alter the visual appearance of the stroke, but affects behaviors that rely on the point order, such as the :doc:`Build Modifier </grease_pencil/modifiers/generate/build>`."
