#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/edit/weight_proximity.rst:8
#: ../../manual/modeling/modifiers/modify/weight_proximity.rst:8
msgid "This modifier sets the weights of the given vertex group, based on the distance between the object (or its vertices), and another target object (or its geometry)."
msgstr "Denna modifierare ställer in vikterna för den angivna vertexgruppen, baserat på avståndet mellan objektet (eller dess vertexer) och ett annat målobjekt (eller dess geometri)."

#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/edit/weight_proximity.rst:19
msgid "This documentation refers to the Vertex Weight Proximity Modifier specific to the Grease Pencil object. For uses with other object types refer to the general :doc:`/modeling/modifiers/modify/weight_proximity`."
msgstr "Denna dokumentation hänvisar till Vertex Weight Proximity Modifier som är specifik för Grease Pencil-objektet. För användning med andra objekttyper hänvisas till den allmänna :doc:`/modeling/modifiers/modify/weight_proximity`."

#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/edit/weight_proximity.rst:39
#: ../../manual/modeling/modifiers/modify/weight_proximity.rst:37
