msgstr "Modifieraren Dot Dash."

#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/generate/dash.rst:20
msgid "Determines the starting offset of the pattern."
msgstr "Bestämmer startoffset för mönstret."

#: ../../manual/grease_pencil/modifiers/generate/dash.rst:22
