msgstr "En NURBS-kurva med Cyclic applicerad."

#: ../../manual/modeling/curves/properties/active_spline.rst:35
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves/properties/active_spline.rst:68
#: ../../manual/modeling/curves/properties/active_spline.rst:135
