#: ../../manual/modeling/geometry_nodes/input/scene/object_info.rst:16
msgid "An *Object Info* node can be added quickly by dragging an object into the node editor."
msgstr "En *Object Info*-nod kan snabbt läggas till genom att dra ett objekt till nodredigeraren."

#: ../../manual/modeling/geometry_nodes/input/scene/object_info.rst:23
