msgstr ":kbd:`G`, :kbd:`G`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/edge_slide.rst:15
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:79
msgid "Slides one or more edges across adjacent faces with a few restrictions involving the selection of edges (i.e. the selection *must* define a valid loop, see below)."
msgstr "Skjut en eller flera kanter över angränsande ytor med några begränsningar när det gäller valet av kanter (t.ex. valet *måste* definiera en giltig loop, se nedan)."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/edge_slide.rst:18
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/loopcut_slide.rst:100
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/vertex/slide_vertices.rst:20
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:61
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:85
