msgstr "Spegelredigering"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/edge_slide.rst:30
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:93
msgid "Lets you propagate the operation to the symmetrical elements of the mesh (if present, in local X direction)."
msgstr "Gör att du kan sprida åtgärden till de symmetriska elementen i nätet (om sådana finns, i lokal X-riktning)."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/edge_slide.rst:31
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/loopcut_slide.rst:135
#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/edge/offset_edge_slide.rst:28
