msgstr ":menuselection:`Ansikte --> Ansiktsdata --> Flip Quad Tessellation`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/face/face_data.rst:64
msgid "Internally, all :term:`quads <Quad>` are :term:`Tessellated <Tessellation>` into 2 triangles, this operator swaps which way the quad is split into triangles."
msgstr "Internt är alla :term:`kvadrater <Quad>` :term:`Tessellerade <Tessellation>` i 2 trianglar, denna operator byter vilket sätt kvadraten delas in i trianglar."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/editing/face/face_data.rst:76
