msgstr "Kopierar UV:er från ena sidan av det speglade nätet till den andra. Påverkar endast valda vertikaler (på båda sidor)."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:153
msgid "Axis Direction"
msgstr "Riktning för axel"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:154
msgid "Positive/Negative"
msgstr "Positiv/Negativ"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:156
msgid "Tolerance for finding vertex duplicates."
msgstr "Tolerans för att hitta dubbletter av toppar."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:169
msgid ":menuselection:`UV --> Snap`"
msgstr "::menuselection:`UV --> Snap`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:172
msgid "Snapping in the UV Editor is similar to :doc:`Snapping in 3D </editors/3dview/controls/snapping>`. For the snap to pixel options to work an image has to be loaded."
msgstr "Snapping i UV Redigerare liknar :doc:`Snapping i 3D </editors/3dview/controls/snapping>`. För att alternativen snap to pixel ska fungera måste en bild laddas."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:176
msgid "Selected to Pixels"
msgstr "Utvalda till pixlar"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:177
msgid "Moves selection to nearest pixel. See also *Round to Pixels* below."
