#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:189
msgid "Cursor to Origin"
msgstr "Cursor till ursprung"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:190
msgid "Places the cursor to the location (0, 0, 0)."
msgstr "Placerar markören på positionen (0, 0, 0)."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:202
msgid ":menuselection:`UV --> Merge`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`UV --> Sammanfoga`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:206
msgid "Moves selected UVs to their average position."
msgstr "Flyttar valda UV:er till deras genomsnittsposition."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:208
msgid "Moves selection UVs to 2D cursor location."
msgstr "Flyttar urvalets UV:er till markörens 2D-position."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:220
msgid ":menuselection:`UV --> Merge --> By Distance`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`UV --> Sammanfoga --> Efter avstånd`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:222
msgid "Merges selected UVs within the specified *Merge Distance*."
msgstr "Sammanfogar valda UV:er inom det angivna *Merge Distance*."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:225
msgid "Maximum distance between merged vertices."
msgstr "Maximalt avstånd mellan sammanslagna toppar."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:227
msgid "Merge selected to other unselected vertices."
msgstr "Slå samman valda med andra omarkerade hörn."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:229
msgid "Merge UVs that correspond to the same mesh vertex, even if they have different UV coordinates."
msgstr "Slå samman UV-bilder som motsvarar samma mesh-vertex, även om de har olika UV-koordinater."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:241
msgid ":menuselection:`UV --> Split`"
msgstr "::menuselection:`UV --> Split`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:244
msgid "Selection :kbd:`Y`"
msgstr "Urval :kbd:`Y`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:245
msgid "Splits (disconnects) the selection from the rest of the UV. The border edge to any non-selected elements are duplicated."
msgstr "Delar (kopplar bort) markeringen från resten av UV:n. Randkanten till alla icke markerade element dupliceras."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:248
msgid "Note that the \"copy\" is left exactly at the same position as the original, so you must move it to see it clearly."
msgstr "Observera att \"kopian\" lämnas exakt på samma plats som originalet, så du måste flytta den för att se den tydligt."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:259
msgid ":menuselection:`UV --> Unwrap`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`UV --> Unwrap`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:262
msgid "Blender offers several ways of mapping UVs. The simpler projection methods use formulas that map 3D space onto 2D space, by interpolating the position of points toward a point, axis or plane through a surface. The more advanced methods can be used with more complex models, and have more specific uses."
msgstr "Blender erbjuder flera sätt att mappa UV-bilder. De enklare projektionsmetoderna använder formler som mappar 3D-rymd till 2D-rymd genom att interpolera punkternas position mot en punkt, axel eller ett plan genom en yta. De mer avancerade metoderna kan användas med mer komplexa modeller och har mer specifika användningsområden."

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:267
msgid ":ref:`bpy.ops.uv.unwrap`"
msgstr ":ref:`bpy.ops.uv.unwrap`"

#: ../../manual/modeling/meshes/uv/editing.rst:268
