msgstr "Strecken ritas utanför objektgränsen."

#: ../../manual/render/freestyle/view_layer/line_style/thickness.rst:27
msgid "Specifies the relative position by a number between 0.0 (inside) and 1.0 (outside), in the *Thickness Ratio* number field just below."
