msgstr "6.1 Surround"

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:31
msgid "Output a six audio channels with one :abbr:`LFE (low-frequency effects)` channel."
msgstr "Utmatning av sex ljudkanaler med en :abbr:`LFE (low-frequency effects)`-kanal."

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:35
msgid "Some *Audio Containers* also have option to choose a codec. For more information see :doc:`here </files/media/video_formats>`."
msgstr "Vissa *Audio Containers* har också möjlighet att välja en codec. För mer information se :doc:`here </files/media/video_formats>`."

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:41
msgid "Split Channels"
msgstr "Delade kanaler"

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:42
msgid "Each audio channel will be rendered into a separate file."
msgstr "Varje ljudkanal kommer att renderas till en separat fil."

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:46
msgid "See :ref:`Scene Audio <data-scenes-audio>` settings."
msgstr "Se :ref:`Scene Audio <data-scenes-audio>` inställningar."

#: ../../manual/render/output/audio/introduction.rst:47
