#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:32
msgid "Based on the 2012 `paper <https://cgg.mff.cuni.cz/projects/SkylightModelling/>`__ by Hosek and Wilkie."
msgstr "Baserat på Hosek och Wilkies artikel <https://cgg.mff.cuni.cz/projects/SkylightModelling/>`__ från 2012."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:33
msgid "Nishita"
msgstr "Nishita"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:34
msgid "Improved version of the 1993 `model <https://www.scratchapixel.com/lessons/procedural-generation-virtual-worlds/simulating-sky/simulating- colors-of-the-sky.html>`__ by Nishita et al."
msgstr "Förbättrad version av 1993 års `modell <https://www.scratchapixel.com/lessons/procedural-generation-virtual-worlds/simulating-sky/simulating- colors-of-the-sky.html>`__ av Nishita et al."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:39
msgid "Note that this sky type is quite bright and makes the image look overexposed with the default scene settings. You can reduce the Exposure setting in :menuselection:`Properties --> Render --> Film` to fix this."
msgstr "Observera att denna himmelstyp är ganska ljus och gör att bilden ser överexponerad ut med standardinställningarna för scenen. Du kan minska Exposure-inställningen i :menuselection:`Egenskaper --> Rendera --> Film` för att åtgärda detta."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:42
msgid "Sun Direction"
msgstr "Solens riktning"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:43
msgid "Sun direction vector."
msgstr "Solens riktningsvektor."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:45
msgid "Turbidity"
msgstr "Turbiditet"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:46
msgid "Atmospheric turbidity."
msgstr "Atmosfärisk grumlighet."

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:48
msgid "2: Arctic like"
msgstr "2: Arktis som"

#: ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/textures/sky.rst:49
