#: ../../manual/sculpt_paint/sculpting/tools/mask_tools.rst:28
msgid "Creates a new :doc:`Mask </sculpt_paint/sculpting/editing/mask>` based on a :ref:`box gesture <gesture-tool-box>`."
msgstr "Skapar en ny :doc:`Mask </sculpt_paint/sculpting/editing/mask>` baserat på en :ref:`box gesture <gesture-tool-box>`."

#: ../../manual/sculpt_paint/sculpting/tools/mask_tools.rst:39
